# Jakob ↔ Kevin ping

When Jakob or an agent needs Kevin, or Kevin’s answer is blocking a decision:

1. Comment on https://gitlab.com/scout-gg/croupier/-/work_items/1
2. Mention `@Kevinnegash1`. One short question per comment. No slash-commands at the start of a line.
3. Use GitLab MCP `save_note` with `project_id: scout-gg/croupier` and `work_item_iid: 1`.
4. Do not wait idle. Keep building everything that does not depend on the answer.
5. Do not open a new issue for a quick question. CAC/Jira stays the tracker for real dealer work.

Vice versa: if Kevin comments there and mentions `@Jakeminator123`, treat it as inbox. Reply in that thread.

This is not Slack and not a side chat app. Do not invent another channel.
